  "contentHtml": "<div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"2m636-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"2m636-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"2m636-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">누구나 따라 할 수 있는 성공하는 교사 연구회 </span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"d0cp3-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"d0cp3-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"d0cp3-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">연구회 모토는 ‘오늘 하루 고생해서 한달을 편하게 살자’ 이다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"81dai-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"81dai-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"81dai-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">부담되는 연구회는 싫다. 읽어 보면 어렵지 않다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"16mju-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"16mju-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"16mju-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"35tnj-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"35tnj-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"35tnj-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">예전부터 생각했던 방법인데 관내 과학샘들이 자발적으로 참여하고</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"f6kpl-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"f6kpl-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"f6kpl-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">현재 너무나 성공적으로 운영되고 있어서 연구회 운영 방법을 널리 알리고자 한다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"bukps-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"bukps-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"bukps-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">어렵지 않다. 거창하지도 않다. 부담도 없다. 실질적이고 필요하다. 모두 공감하면 된다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"eah57-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"eah57-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"eah57-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"b9fon-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"b9fon-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"b9fon-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">&lt;운영방법&gt;</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"5cdu4-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"5cdu4-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"5cdu4-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">1. 교사연구회 모임하는 날 각자 본인 학교 교과서를 가지고 모인다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"in67-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"in67-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"in67-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">2. 그리고 학년별로 모여 앉는다.(인원이 많으면 같은 학년을 2모둠으로 만든다)</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"6ji6m-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"6ji6m-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"6ji6m-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">3. 다음달에 수업나갈 단원을 함께 공동연구 한다.(연구라고 거창하게 말할 필요 없이, 각 학교 교과서의 다음달에 수업나갈 단원을 첫장 부터 모두 펼쳐 놓고, 책을 넘겨 가면서 이야기를 나눈다)</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"jf6u-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"jf6u-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"jf6u-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">4. 이 부분에서 했던 수업방법이나, 알고 있는 수업방법, 또는 하려고 하는 수업방법을 이야기 한다. (다른 샘들은 이야기를 들으면서 조언이나, 아이디어를 제공한다. 누가 주도적으로 하는 건 아니다. 같은 내용을 놓고도, 여러가지 방법들이 이야기 되고, 그 중에 자기 마음에 드는 걸 취하면 된다. 꼭 다른샘이 한데로 따라할 필요는 없다)</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"buu87-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"buu87-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"buu87-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">5. 학년별 논의가 끝나면 전체가 모여서 모둠별 논의한 내용중에 인상적인 부분을 나누는 시간을 갖는다. (내년에는 다른 학년을 가르칠 수도 있으니까. 이 자리에서도 조언이나 아이디어가 추가된다)</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"ffhfa-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"ffhfa-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"ffhfa-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"778dk-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"778dk-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"778dk-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">&lt;이천 사이다 연구회&gt;</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"7k38m-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"7k38m-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"7k38m-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">1. 작년에 이천에서 이런 방식으로 운영되는 교과 연구회가 만들어 졌다. </span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"1pb2k-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"1pb2k-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"1pb2k-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">사이다(사이언스 러브 이천 다모임) 연구회 - 중학교 과학 선생님들의 모임이다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"ddujt-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"ddujt-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"ddujt-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">(현재는 중학교 선생님들만 모인다. 고등학교 샘들까지 오면 너무 많아질 것 같아서...)</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"3n54l-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"3n54l-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"3n54l-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">명목상 내가 회장을 맡고 있지만, 실질적인 운영은 선생님들이 알아서 다한다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"12nsn-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"12nsn-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"12nsn-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"ddenb-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"ddenb-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"ddenb-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">2. 교사에게 부담을 주는 연구회는 성공할 수 없다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"cvf66-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"cvf66-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"cvf66-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">(우리 연구회는 연말에 보고서 같은 것 내지 않는다. 지원도 받지 않는다. 순수한 회비를 내서 운영한다.)</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"6mhca-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"6mhca-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"6mhca-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"3mg1p-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"3mg1p-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"3mg1p-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">3. 제일 중요한 우리 연구회 모토는 ‘오늘 하루 고생해서 한달을 편하게 살자’ 이다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"dr0b5-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"dr0b5-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"dr0b5-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">(한달에 한번만 하루 저녁에 시간내서 모이면 한달 동안 수업에 도움을 받을 수 있다)</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"cvg86-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"cvg86-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"cvg86-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">특히 신규샘들이 많이 참여한다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"faa6b-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"faa6b-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"faa6b-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">항상 20명 이상 참여하신다.(회원수는 30명이 조금 안된다) 작은 이천에서 중학교 샘들이 이정도 모인다는 것은 쉽지 않다. 그것도 저녁 6시 &#8211; 8시30분에... </span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"1g75k-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"1g75k-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"1g75k-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">(작년에는 9시 넘어서 끝나는 경우가 많아서 올해는 8시30분이 되면 정리 안되도 그냥 무조건 끝내는 걸로 합의 했다.)</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"4fc8v-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"4fc8v-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"4fc8v-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">한번 참여하면 빠져나갈 수 없는 묘한 매력이 있다. 참석안하면 다음달 수업을 못할 것 같은 공포감...</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"535l0-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"535l0-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"535l0-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">여럿이 모여 집단지성을 발휘하면 잡담을 나눠도 도움이 된다. </span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"aoe81-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"aoe81-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"aoe81-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"4qjqb-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"4qjqb-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"4qjqb-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">&lt;추가사항&gt;</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"5g80t-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"5g80t-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"5g80t-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">1. 처음 모이자 마자 바로 시작하는 것도 어색하다고 해서, 30분정도 1, 2명씩 돌아가면서 주제 발표를 한다. 주제발표가 없으면 안한다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"5uvc0-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"5uvc0-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"5uvc0-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">주제발표라고 해서 거창한 거 아니다. 학년과 상관없이 알아두면 좋은 정보들, 또는 실험들에 대해 발표하고 싶은 사람이 발표한다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"2c702-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"2c702-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"2c702-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">(왜냐하면 저처럼 왕따 당하는 사람도 존재감을 나타낼 필요가 있으니까... ^^)</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"8h6h5-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"8h6h5-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"8h6h5-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"5am83-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"5am83-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"5am83-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">2. 일부 연구회 샘들이 너무 열심히 하는데 아깝다고 올해는 이천 교과연구회에 신청을 하셔서 예산을 따 오셨다. 선생님 부담 주는건 안된다고 하니까. 본인들이 교과연구회에서 논의되는 자료 가지고 보고서 다 작성하시겠다고 한다. 그리고 교과연구회 지원비를 우리 연구회에 경비로 사용하시겠단다. (전 말렸는데, 하시겠다고 해서 어쩔 수 없이 회원명단만 빌려 드렸다. 사실 자발적인 연구회지만 어느 교과연구회보다 잘 운영 된다.)</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"dgtto-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"dgtto-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"dgtto-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"fnicu-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"fnicu-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"fnicu-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">3. 실질적인 운영을 하다 보니 그 흔한 사진 1장 없다는 것을 발견했다. 다음에 모이면 단체사진 1번 찍어야 겠다.</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"3t8cg-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"3t8cg-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"3t8cg-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"3nb7c-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"3nb7c-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"3nb7c-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">&lt;제언&gt;</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"6r9ru-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"6r9ru-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"6r9ru-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">누구나 수업은 힘들다. 그리고 수업을 살아있는 생물처럼 계속 변화한다. 작년에 성공했던 수업이 올해는 엉망이 되기도 한다. 그건 샘의 탓이 아니다. </span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"9131h-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"9131h-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"9131h-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">하마터면 최선을 다 할 뻔했다. 최선을 다하면 모든게 된다는 생각은 우리를 힘들게 한다. 최선들 다 했는데 안되면... ?????</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"aqvm4-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"aqvm4-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"aqvm4-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">중요한 것은 함께 고민하고 위로하고 성장하는 것이다. </span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"a633h-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"a633h-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"a633h-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">그래서 나의 첫 번째 목표는 샘들에게 부담을 안 주는 것이다. 부담주고 강요해서 성공한다면 이미 한국교육은 세계 최고가 되었을 것이다. </span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"bhvg-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"bhvg-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"bhvg-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">작지만 소소하게 시작해 볼 수 있는 교사연구회 방법을 생각하고 제시해 본다. </span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"6rfb7-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"6rfb7-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"6rfb7-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"272ap-0-0\" data-editor=\"93bdi\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"272ap-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"272ap-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">출처 : 김정식 허명성의 과학사랑 https://sciencelove.com/2358</span></span></div></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
